{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/3aa99dc7b444d58b129c314701c75f6c.poster.avif?t=1770841550\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/3aa99dc7b444d58b129c314701c75f6c.webm?t=1770841550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/3aa99dc7b444d58b129c314701c75f6c.mp4?t=1770841550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DINO MAYHEM!</strong><br>Get your claws out and leave a (massive) footprint in this legendary Dino game! Rampage through cities and sink your teeth into destruction by chomping down on buildings, animals, and all the bipeds that get in your way. Level up your apex status with modern tech like jetpacks and laser guns to bring down your enemies at Dyno-Tech Corporation. Sure, they made you, but they can never control you. Mayhem has never tasted this T-Riffic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTROY</strong> buildings and level cites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EAT</strong> humans and other creatures to regain health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong> your way through the forces of the evil company, Dyno-Tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIELD</strong> high-tech weapons to cause mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESCUE</strong> other dinosaurs to help you on your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE\u00a0</strong>an action-packed, level based story campaign across multiple distinct environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK</strong> a variety of colorful new skins for your dinos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-PLAYER</strong> local co-op and PvP.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2614930?t=1770841550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/9654231fceaf882c67a1adfaa7fba904f3ee0b7c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770841550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/c9dc3148a42ea5ae244b26f5e3dd7df0daf24a6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770841550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/c9dc3148a42ea5ae244b26f5e3dd7df0daf24a6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770841550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4389300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/3aa99dc7b444d58b129c314701c75f6c.poster.avif?t=1770841550\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/3aa99dc7b444d58b129c314701c75f6c.webm?t=1770841550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/extras/3aa99dc7b444d58b129c314701c75f6c.mp4?t=1770841550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DINO MAYHEM!</strong><br>Get your claws out and leave a (massive) footprint in this legendary Dino game! Rampage through cities and sink your teeth into destruction by chomping down on buildings, animals, and all the bipeds that get in your way. Level up your apex status with modern tech like jetpacks and laser guns to bring down your enemies at Dyno-Tech Corporation. Sure, they made you, but they can never control you. Mayhem has never tasted this T-Riffic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTROY</strong> buildings and level cites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EAT</strong> humans and other creatures to regain health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong> your way through the forces of the evil company, Dyno-Tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIELD</strong> high-tech weapons to cause mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESCUE</strong> other dinosaurs to help you on your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE\u00a0</strong>an action-packed, level based story campaign across multiple distinct environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK</strong> a variety of colorful new skins for your dinos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-PLAYER</strong> local co-op and PvP.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Incan Arcade Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614930/5990a9b2eb3ca4aec3d7ef492eb81a638933887e/header.jpg?t=1770841550","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2614930/1241591937/57ef9c0262f68b4173abd8e9973d1fd94e44a98c/1770265203/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770841097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2614930/1241591937/57ef9c0262f68b4173abd8e9973d1fd94e44a98c/1770265203/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770